    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1_error" kindref="compound">Error</ref> class wrapping ErrorCode with optional context information</para>
<para>Provides a production-ready error type that:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Carries structured error codes from ErrorRegistry</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Includes dynamic context (e.g., file paths, resource IDs)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Supports error chaining and propagation </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
